#: ../../source/app_changelog.rst:8
msgid "App Changelog"
msgstr "应用更新日志"

#: ../../source/app_changelog.rst:11
msgid "Releases"
msgstr "发行版本"

#: ../../source/app_changelog.rst:14
msgid "Version 0.9"
msgstr "版本 0.9"

#: ../../source/app_changelog.rst:16
msgid "Diagram editor :"
msgstr "原理图编辑器："

#: ../../source/app_changelog.rst:18
msgid "Improved QElectroTech speed (launch qet, open project, function)"
msgstr "提升了 QElectroTech 的速度（启动 QET、打开项目等操作）"

#: ../../source/app_changelog.rst:19
msgid ""
"A drop-down list has been added to the toolbar to change the size of the "
"resize handles."
msgstr "工具栏中新增了一个下拉列表，用于更改调整大小手柄的尺寸。"

#: ../../source/app_changelog.rst:20
msgid "Element Editor:"
msgstr "元件编辑器："

#: ../../source/app_changelog.rst:22
msgid ""
"The \"keep visual rotation\" property of element texts is editable from the "
"element editor."
msgstr "元件文本的“保持视觉旋转”属性可在元件编辑器中编辑。"

#: ../../source/app_changelog.rst:23
msgid ""
"Thanks to the work of antonioaja it is now possible to import a dxf directly"
" from the element editor in a completely transparent way for the user."
msgstr "得益于 antonioaja 的工作，现在可以直接从元件编辑器导入 DXF，对用户而言完全透明。"

#: ../../source/app_changelog.rst:24
msgid ""
"In the background QElectroTech uses the `dxf2elmt software. "
"<https://qelectrotech.org/forum/viewtopic.php?id=2265 "
"https://github.com/antonioaja/dxf2elmt>`_"
msgstr ""
"在后台，QElectroTech 使用 `dxf2elmt 软件。 "
"<https://qelectrotech.org/forum/viewtopic.php?id=2265 "
"https://github.com/antonioaja/dxf2elmt>`_"

#: ../../source/app_changelog.rst:25
msgid ""
"Improved responsiveness when multiple shapes are selected or deleted, "
"especially when working on a `large converted DXF element. "
"<https://qelectrotech.org/forum/viewtopic.php?pid=16612#p16612>`_"
msgstr ""
"提升了选择或删除多个图形时的响应速度，尤其是在处理 `大型转换后的 DXF 元件时。 "
"<https://qelectrotech.org/forum/viewtopic.php?pid=16612#p16612>`_"

#: ../../source/app_changelog.rst:26
msgid "Other:"
msgstr "其他："

#: ../../source/app_changelog.rst:28
msgid "Add a \"side project\" tab in the \"about\" window."
msgstr "在“关于”窗口中新增“侧项目”标签页。"

#: ../../source/app_changelog.rst:29
msgid ""
"In the general QElectroTech configuration, a drop down list allows to choose"
" the scaling method for hdpi screens."
msgstr "在 QElectroTech 常规配置中，可通过下拉列表选择高分屏（HDPI）的缩放方式。"

#: ../../source/app_changelog.rst:30
msgid ""
"Allow `open polygons (i.e. polylines) when saving in dxf format. "
"<https://qelectrotech.org/forum/viewtopic.php?pid=16611#p16611>`_"
msgstr ""
"保存为 DXF 格式时允许 `开放多边形（即折线）。 "
"<https://qelectrotech.org/forum/viewtopic.php?pid=16611#p16611>`_"

#: ../../source/app_changelog.rst:31
msgid ""
"Added 'Other' option for `slave device contact type. #222 "
"<https://qelectrotech.org/forum/viewtopic.php?id=2264>`_"
msgstr ""
"为 `从设备触点类型新增了“其他”选项。#222 "
"<https://qelectrotech.org/forum/viewtopic.php?id=2264>`_"

#: ../../source/app_changelog.rst:33
msgid "Logs:"
msgstr "日志："

#: ../../source/app_changelog.rst:35
msgid ""
"Added a QElapsedTimer to calculate the time used to reload the item "
"collection."
msgstr "新增 QElapsedTimer，用于计算重新加载元件集合所用的时间。"

#: ../../source/app_changelog.rst:36
msgid ""
"Improved QElapsedTimer to calculate the time used to reload the item "
"collection in seconds instead of ms."
msgstr "改进 QElapsedTimer，以秒而非毫秒为单位计算重新加载元件集合的时间。"

#: ../../source/app_changelog.rst:37
msgid ""
"Added Linux pc.gpu.RAM information, but requires mesa-utils dependency on "
"the Linux OS."
msgstr "新增 Linux 的 pc.gpu.RAM 信息，但 Linux 系统需要安装 mesa-utils 依赖。"

#: ../../source/app_changelog.rst:38
msgid "Added information about mounted disk volumes."
msgstr "新增已挂载磁盘卷的信息。"

#: ../../source/app_changelog.rst:39
msgid ""
"Added CPU architecture for which Qt was compiled in the aboutqetdialog "
"widget and in the logs."
msgstr "在 aboutqetdialog 控件和日志中新增 Qt 编译所针对的 CPU 架构信息。"

#: ../../source/app_changelog.rst:40
msgid "Added MSVC support to MachineInfo."
msgstr "为 MachineInfo 新增 MSVC 支持。"

#: ../../source/app_changelog.rst:41
msgid "Added RAM information on Windows of available RAM."
msgstr "在 Windows 上新增可用内存信息。"

#: ../../source/app_changelog.rst:42
msgid "Added QElectroTech version to the log file."
msgstr "在日志文件中新增 QElectroTech 版本。"

#: ../../source/app_changelog.rst:43
msgid "Elements collection :"
msgstr "元件集合："

#: ../../source/app_changelog.rst:45
msgid "Improve collection 8274 elements in 1097 categories (i.e. 9371 files)."
msgstr "改进元件集合，包含 1097 个类别中的 8274 个元件（即 9371 个文件）。"
